  "id": "dual-careers",
  "term": "dual careers",
  "definition": "Dual careers are a career-management approach in which a performing artist develops an alternative line of work alongside artistic training or practice, so they are better prepared to shift direction if needed. In this context, it is presented as a way to support a more sustainable career by reducing vulnerability to the short-term and unstable nature of artistic work.",
